Working closely with Project Management, Research and Development, Production, Sales and Product Management on product design and requirements; Testing products to establish functionality and effectiveness; Perform and assist at product trainings, evaluations, configurations and installations (internal and with customers).
Your tasks
Provide system design and solutions based on customer requirements;
Network configuration and design based on customer requirements;
Configure and test the system before delivery;
Analyze and understand customer requirements and create test scenarios;
Create Factory Acceptance Tests and Site Acceptance Tests documents, manage and execute tests and create reports;
Perform on-site system software configuration;
Perform local and on site trainings with customers;
Identify and report issues and eventual improvements to the R&D department;
Remote support for installed systems;
Follow up customer technical requirements and feedback;
Perform Site survey activities and create reports about it
Travel 25% of the working time.
