Good knowledge in computer communications, LAN/WAN, core protocols (TCP/IP, Layer 2&3, network protocols);
Good knowledge in Linux OS (installation, configuration, processes);
Experience on debugging Linux software issues based on logs;
Basic scripting experience (bash, perl);
Experience with VoIP Telephony (SIP, RTP);
Basic experience with databases (Postgresql or MySQL);
Basic Cisco configuration knowledge; Personal competencies
Structured and well-organized;
Ability to define problems, collect data, establish facts, draw valid conclusions and provide solutions;
Excellent verbal and written communication skills;
Team player;
